00:00:07,160 --> 00:00:08,850
It looks perfectly at home under

6
00:00:08,860 --> 00:00:09,730
a jacket sleeve.

7
00:00:10,680 --> 00:00:12,390
But the Cartier Santos begins with

8
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:13,710
a very different problem:

9
00:00:14,280 --> 00:00:15,430
how do you check the time

10
00:00:15,440 --> 00:00:16,910
while you're busy flying?

11
00:00:17,740 --> 00:00:20,010
Before airport lounges, before airline

12
00:00:20,020 --> 00:00:22,410
meals, before anyone complained about

13
00:00:22,420 --> 00:00:24,770
legroom, a Brazilian inventor was taking

14
00:00:24,780 --> 00:00:27,250
experimental flying machines over Paris.

15
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:30,530
His name was Alberto Santos-Dumont.

16
00:00:30,770 --> 00:00:32,700
And according to Cartier's history, he

17
00:00:32,710 --> 00:00:33,960
