68
00:02:10,100 --> 00:02:11,350
The flight brought him the prize

69
00:02:11,360 --> 00:02:12,970
and helped make him a public

70
00:02:12,980 --> 00:02:15,340
figure. For our story, one detail

71
00:02:15,350 --> 00:02:15,980
matters:

72
00:02:16,910 --> 00:02:19,300
time wasn't an abstract number on

73
00:02:19,310 --> 00:02:19,780
