74
00:02:20,350 --> 00:02:21,540
It was part of the challenge.

75
00:02:22,290 --> 00:02:23,120
Picture the contrast.

76
00:02:23,790 --> 00:02:25,780
Down below, a gentleman could pause,

77
00:02:26,250 --> 00:02:28,100
reach into a waistcoat, and consult

78
00:02:28,110 --> 00:02:28,740
his watch.

79
00:02:29,650 --> 00:02:31,240
Up above, the pilot had an

80
00:02:31,250 --> 00:02:33,160
engine and a machine to manage.

81
00:02:34,050 --> 00:02:35,140
A pocket watch could be a

82
00:02:35,150 --> 00:02:36,120
beautiful object.

83
00:02:36,610 --> 00:02:38,160
Accessing it was another matter.

84
00:02:38,990 --> 00:02:40,080
The next step wasn't to make

85
00:02:40,090 --> 00:02:41,300
