rather than a claim that every

134
00:04:10,720 --> 00:04:12,990
detail had a special flying function.

135
00:04:13,840 --> 00:04:15,110
And the Santos you see today

136
00:04:15,120 --> 00:04:16,730
is a family of watches,

137
00:04:17,280 --> 00:04:19,170
not one object frozen in nineteen

138
00:04:19,180 --> 00:04:19,610
oh-four.

139
00:04:20,560 --> 00:04:21,710
Sizes, movements,

140
00:04:22,460 --> 00:04:24,250
straps, and proportions have changed.

141
00:04:25,140 --> 00:04:26,690
A modern bracelet model isn't

142
00:04:26,700 --> 00:04:28,610
Santos-Dumont's original watch.

143
00:04:29,420 --> 00:04:31,830
Still, the visual idea holds together.

144
00:04:32,200 --> 00:04:33,490
Put a Santos among a row

145
00:04:33,500 --> 00:04:35,390
of watches, and its outline gives

146
00:04:35,400 --> 00:04:36,450
