148
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:38,410
name.

149
00:04:41,080 --> 00:04:43,070
Meanwhile, Santos-Dumont's experiments

150
00:04:43,080 --> 00:04:44,010
kept moving.

151
00:04:44,520 --> 00:04:46,270
In nineteen oh-six, he made public

