172
00:05:25,120 --> 00:05:26,190
shape around it.

173
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:28,670
Yet airplanes wouldn't be the watch's

174
00:05:28,680 --> 00:05:29,450
whole future.

175
00:05:29,690 --> 00:05:31,860
In nineteen eleven, the Santos design

176
00:05:31,870 --> 00:05:33,280
reached a wider market.

177
00:05:33,870 --> 00:05:35,900
A solution associated with one aviator

178
00:05:35,910 --> 00:05:37,920
now had a life beyond him.

179
00:05:40,120 --> 00:05:41,810
At this point, you'll often hear

180
00:05:41,820 --> 00:05:44,130
the Santos described as the first

181
00:05:44,140 --> 00:05:44,770
wristwatch.

182
00:05:45,420 --> 00:05:47,190
That's a neat headline, but the

183
00:05:47,200 --> 00:05:48,030
history is longer.

184
00:05:49,040 --> 00:05:50,470
The Louvre's Breguet exhibition

185
00:05:50,480 --> 00:05:52,870
documents a watch designed for the

186
00:05:52,880 --> 00:05:54,410
