00:06:19,040 --> 00:06:20,850
That distinction brings us back to

203
00:06:20,860 --> 00:06:22,190
the modern watch from the opening.

204
00:06:22,980 --> 00:06:24,770
The flying problem explains its

205
00:06:24,780 --> 00:06:26,390
beginning. But it doesn't, on its

206
00:06:26,400 --> 00:06:28,250
